@*
    About Us Foundation phase (2026-08-01) — docs/03_PageBlueprints.md
    "Page — About Us". Title/description/canonical/OG/AboutPage schema come
    from ViewData["Seo"] + ViewData["SeoPageType"], set in
    AboutController.Index via ISeoService — see _Layout.cshtml's <head> and
    SeoStructuredDataViewComponent.

    Foundation phase built the first three sections — Hero Banner, Company
    Introduction, Our Journey — mirroring Project Detail's phased approach
    (docs/14_Decisions.md, "Project Detail Foundation"), with Mission &
    Vision and Areas of Expertise reserved as HTML comment anchors so the
    page never needed reshaping when they landed. Both are now implemented
    (2026-08-01) — see MissionVisionViewComponent / AreasOfExpertiseViewComponent,
    both built on Information Card's Grid layout (InformationCardModel.Layout)
    rather than new Mission Card/Vision Card/Expertise Card components.
    Projects CTA / Partner Logos / Footer are already global
    (_Layout.cshtml), so this page needs no section of its own for them.

    Hero Banner uses a dedicated placeholder banner image
    (wwwroot/images/hero/about-placeholder.svg) rather than the neutral
    gradient HeroBannerStandard falls back to when no image is supplied —
    project owner's explicit 2026-08-01 request, matching Project Detail's
    "always has its own banner" precedent. Company Introduction and Our
    Journey both reuse existing reusable pieces (Section Header, Image
    Block, History Info Panel, History Carousel) rather than introducing
    new ones — see CompanyIntroductionViewComponent / OurJourneyViewComponent.
*@

@{
    var breadcrumbTrail = new List<AncinInsaat.ViewComponents.BreadcrumbItem>
    {
        new() { Label = "Hakkımızda" }
    };
}
@await Component.InvokeAsync("Breadcrumb", new { trail = breadcrumbTrail })

@await Component.InvokeAsync("HeroBannerStandard", new
{
    heading = "Hakkımızda",
    subheading = "Aydın'da yarım asra yaklaşan bir yolculuk: güven, zanaatkârlık ve kalıcı yaşam alanları.",
    backgroundImageUrl = "/images/hero/about-placeholder.svg"
})

@await Component.InvokeAsync("CompanyIntroduction")

@await Component.InvokeAsync("OurJourney")
